{"articleNo":"2370","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=2370&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2009-2학기 대학원 2차 졸업외국어시험면제 신청 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2009.11.20","hit":"14055","attachments":[{"name":"면제신청원(양식)[1].hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2370&attachNo=1974"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"></p>\n<table style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" bgcolor=\"#ffffcc\" height=\"30\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"420\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">2009-2 일반대학원 졸업외국어시험 면제신청(2차) 안내</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"> </span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<p></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\">1. 신청자격 : </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">2학기 이상 등록한 일반대학원 석ㆍ박사과정 재학생</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(수료자는 2009-2학기에 수료자 등록을 필한 자)</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">2. 제출서류 </span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;▶면제신청원 1부, 면제관련 증빙서류(사본) 1부 첨부 </span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">3. 졸업외국어시험 면제요건 </span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 본교 대학원 해당과정 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">재학 중</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">(최근 3년이내)에 TOEIC 성적이 500점</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(TOEFL, TEPS의 점수는 토익 500점에 상응하는 점수)이상을 취득한 자</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 본교 대학원 해당과정 재학 중 어학교육원에서 시행하는 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">중급이상</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\">의 </span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">영어강좌를 40시간 이상 이수한 자</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\"> </span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">4. 졸업외국어시험 면제신청 접수기간 및 장소</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 접수 기간 : </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">2009. 12. 1.(화) ~ 12. 4.(금) &lt;4일간&gt;</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 접수 장소 : </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">각 학과 종합학사행정실</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 면제신청원 양식 : 첨부파일 참조</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\">5. 합격자 발표 :</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"> 2009. 12. 14.(월)</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\"> 원스톱서비스</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;☞ 경로 : 원스톱서비스/로그인/학적자료조회/외국어시험(Y or N)으로 표기</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\"><br></span></p>\n<span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"